WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.834 --> 00:00:02.100
-I'm very excited.

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.133
There's a lot of fun things
going on right now.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.234
Thanksgiving
is only two days away.

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:05.667
-Ooh!
-Right? Yes.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:08.234
I have a --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.234 --> 00:00:11.834
I have a new holiday song out
with Dolly Parton called

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:13.534
"Almost Too Early
for Christmas."

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:14.634
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:17.601 --> 00:00:21.167
So, I released this song
in October.

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:22.467
-Right.
-I thought that would be --

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:24.801
-Almost too early.
-It's almost too early.

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:26.167
-Right.
-It's before Mariah.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:27.601
-Right.
-Yeah.

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:31.400
You play this song, it's just
a little too early to play.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.834
It's not --
We're not ready for the song.

00:00:33.834 --> 00:00:36.067
Anyways, I talked about it
on the show

00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:38.400
and I said, "You know what would
be a dream for me?

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.467
Is if we could be
the on-hold music

00:00:40.467 --> 00:00:43.067
for the Butterball hotline.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.868
-That'd be good. That's worthy.

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:48.200
-That's -- I mean, that's
where -- I mean, you're --

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.601
-That's "Top of the Pops," yeah.

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:51.300
-You're kind of stuck
there on the phone

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.767
waiting to get turkey tips
from Butterball.

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:55.934
