00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:57.601
-Well, I mean, you got to know
how -- what to do.

00:00:57.601 --> 00:00:59.901
You have stuffing questions.
There's side questions.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.634
You have -- I mean,
it's probably things

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:03.567
outside of turkey, is it?

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:05.501
The Butterball hotline?
Or is it just turkey only?

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:06.601
-I bet if you asked them
about mashed potatoes,

00:01:06.601 --> 00:01:07.934
they'd tell you.

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:09.234
-Yeah, they have to, right?

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:12.234
So, anyways, I heard that
Butterball said yes.

00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:14.634
[ Cheers and applause ]
And that they --

00:01:17.901 --> 00:01:20.567
So I thought, let's try it out

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:23.968
and see if we are the
on-hold music for Butterball.

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:26.267
-What is that?
-This is a phone.

00:01:26.267 --> 00:01:29.701
-That's a phone?
-What do you mean what is this?

00:01:29.701 --> 00:01:31.767
-I was born in '92, man.
-It's a telephone.

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.100
-I don't know what that is.
-Telephone, man.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.100
-So, it's 1-800-Butterball,
right?

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:39.901
1-800-Butterball.
Do I have to press something?

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:42.567
-You have to do 9 to get out.

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.567
[ Dialing ]

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:52.501
I feel like Butterball is
longer than the actual number.

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.868
-Welcome to Butterball.

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:57.868
To be connected to our
Butterball Turkey Talk-Line,

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:00.267
for information on
turkey preparation

00:02:00.267 --> 00:02:03.667
and cooking assistance,
press or say 3.

00:02:03.667 --> 00:02:05.000
If you have a --
[ Beep ]

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.701
Your call may be
monitored or recorded

00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:07.701
to ensure quality
customer service.

00:02:07.701 --> 00:02:09.767
-I hope it is.

00:02:09.767 --> 00:02:11.901
-Thank you for calling
the Butterball Turkey Talk-Line.

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:13.167
-You're welcome.

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:15.634
-All turkey experts
are assisting other callers.

00:02:15.634 --> 00:02:18.400
Your estimated wait time
is about one minute.

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.334
For self-service options
to frequently asked questions...

00:02:21.334 --> 00:02:25.334
-Get to the goods.
-...or visit butterball.com

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:29.367
for information on turkey
preparation, recipes, and more.

00:02:29.367 --> 00:02:31.434
If you would like to leave
a call-back number

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:33.901
and keep your place in line,
press 2,

00:02:33.901 --> 00:02:37.934
or remain on the line
for the next available expert.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.300
♪♪

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:46.634 --> 00:02:49.467
-Yes! Butterball!

00:02:49.467 --> 00:02:51.000
Yes!

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.334
That is a Christmas miracle!

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:56.200
It's a Thanksgiving miracle!

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:57.300
Thank you, Butterball!

